#     key      internal id for the metric (stable; safe to reference)
#     header   column label in the table / CSV
#     metric   Prometheus series name queried
#     uuidlbl  UUID label to join on: DCGM uses 'UUID', nvidia exporter uses 'uuid'
#     reducer  window reduction: avg=avg_over_time, max=max_over_time,
#              delta=max_over_time-min_over_time (monotonic energy counter)
#     scale    display multiplier: 100 (0-1 fraction -> %), 1/1024 (MiB->GiB),
#              1e-6 (bytes/s -> MB/s), 1/3.6e9 (mJ -> kWh)
#     dec      decimal places shown (0 -> rounded int)
#     agg      multi-GPU 'Overall' row: mean / sum (energy) / max (peak power)
#     group    default (always shown) or all (only with --all)
#
# Default ("important") columns -- the 6 shown without --all, and how to read them:
#   column    measures                                    how to read it
#   DUTY%     GPU ran any kernel (coarse occupancy)        high is necessary, not sufficient
#   SM_ACT%   SMs engaged (>=1 warp resident)              low while DUTY% high => GPU parked / underfed
#   OCC%      how full the SMs were (warp slots filled)    low => small kernels / weak parallelism
#   TENSOR%   tensor cores doing matmul                    ~0 on an ML job => not using mixed precision
#   DRAM%     HBM bandwidth busy                           high while SM_ACT% low => memory-bound
#   POWER_W   mean board power draw                        near-idle watts => GPU not really working
#
# Diagnostic patterns from these 6 (advisory heuristics; window-averaged, so a
# multi-phase job blurs -- the raw numbers stay the source of truth):
#   pattern             signature                         likely cause / action
#   idle / unused       DUTY~0, SM_ACT~0, POWER~idle       never ran a kernel: crashed early, wrong
#                                                          device, or idle interactive session
#   parked / underfed   DUTY high, SM_ACT & OCC low        resident but cores idle: host/input
#                                                          bottleneck, tiny batch, launch overhead
#   low occupancy       SM_ACT high, OCC low               warp slots underfilled: small kernels;
#                                                          fuse / tune launch config
#   memory-bound        DRAM high, SM_ACT/TENSOR lower     HBM bandwidth is the limiter, not compute
#   no mixed precision  SM_ACT high, TENSOR~0 (ML job)     running fp32: enable AMP / bf16 / tf32
#   healthy             SM_ACT high, OCC ok, TENSOR/FP     good use; POWER near TDP, little to change
#                       high, POWER near TDP
#
# Quick reference -- key -> column -> Prometheus metric -> meaning (time-averaged
# over the run). 6 default + 22 all = 28. All *_ACTIVE/*_UTIL % columns are
# time-FRACTIONS, not instantaneous; expect DUTY% >= ENGINE% >= SM_ACT% >= OCC%,
