#   imma     IMMA%        DCGM_FI_PROF_PIPE_TENSOR_IMMA_ACTIVE   all      tensor pipe, integer ops
#   dfma     DFMA%        DCGM_FI_PROF_PIPE_TENSOR_DFMA_ACTIVE   all      tensor pipe, fp64 ops
